| ---: |\n| ${\\color{blue}10}$ | $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{red}20}$ |\n| ${\\color{blue}20}$ | ${\\color{red}40}$ |\n\nSo, the missing number is $\\color{red}20$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075038 #edb/ref 1065 8357 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075038 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "ca7b3d51-7281-5705-bed5-276f34939c25" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075038 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
